# Purpose: Strip a leading UTF-8 BOM so downstream parsers see the intended first header field.
# Inputs: export.csv: UTF-8 text whose first line may begin with a BOM.
# Outputs: stdout: The same file text with leading BOM characters removed.
accept export_path as text with default "export.csv"
run cat with path export_path
then sed with program "s/^\uFEFF//"
